  "description": "Merlin is a lightweight .NET utility framework providing reusable infrastructure components for application development, including object mapping, type conversion, structured exception handling, resource-based messaging, and extensible data access support. Designed to simplify complex application logic while maintaining clear diagnostics and developer-friendly error reporting.",
